{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53721","headline":"座右铭 · 宗密","name":"座右铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寅起可办事，省语终寡尤。\n身安勤戒定，事简疎交游。\n他非不足辨，己过当自修。\n百岁既有限，世事何时休。\n落发堕僧数，应须侔上流。\n胡爲逐世变，志虑尚嚣浮。\n四恩重山岳，锱铢未能酧。\n蚩蚩居大厦，汲汲将焉求。\n死生在呼吸，起灭若浮沤。\n无令方服下，番作阿鼻由。\n（《缁门警训》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗密","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}